{"type":"message","id":"aaf6dd17","parentId":"95df6079","timestamp":"2026-03-04T04:07:52.002Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-04 12:07 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 2/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: ## Task: UI Optimization for PixelArtEditor\n\n## Workspace: /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor\n\n## Context\nPixelArtEditor needs UI improvements to enhance user experience.\n\n## Requirements\n\n### 1. Toolbar Design\n- Add **Eraser Tool** (橡皮擦) - button to toggle eraser mode\n- Add **Brush Size Selector** - dropdown or buttons (1px, 2px, 4px)\n- Add **Clear Canvas Button** - clears all pixels\n\n### 2. Canvas Optimization\n- Display **Grid Lines** (optional toggle)\n- Show **Pixel Coordinates** on hover\n- Better cursor styles for different tools\n\n### 3. Status Display\n- **Current Color Preview** - show selected color\n- **Canvas Fill Rate (%)** - percentage of non-empty pixels\n- **Compression Status Indicator** - show when compressing\n\n### 4. Style Beautification\n- Modern color scheme\n- Responsive layout\n- Button hover effects\n\n## Deliverable\n- All UI improvements implemented\n- Working demo with new features\n- Verify existing functionality still works\n- Run `npm test` to check for regressions\n\n## Report To: $HOME/.openclaw-reports/code-agent/"}],"timestamp":1772597271999}}
