{"type":"message","id":"b5d707fc","parentId":"24ce24a1","timestamp":"2026-03-04T04:18:16.837Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The previous model said \"Continue where you left off. The previous model attempt failed or timed out.\" but looking at the context, I actually successfully:\n\n1. Updated `index.html` with new toolbar elements\n2. Updated `style.css` with modern styling\n3. Updated `PixelEditor.ts` with new features (eraser, brush sizes, grid, coordinates, fill rate)\n4. Updated `main.ts` to connect all the new UI\n5. Ran `npm test` - all 42 tests passed\n6. Ran `npm run build` - successful build\n\nLooking at the last command output, the build completed successfully. The task requirements were:\n- All UI improvements implemented ✅\n- Working demo with new features ✅ (files created)\n- Verify existing functionality still works ✅ (npm test passed)\n- Run `npm test` to check for regressions ✅ (42 tests passed)\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Write the development report to `$HOME/.openclaw-reports/code-agent/`\n2. Notify completion\n\nLet me write the development report.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"The build completed successfully. Now let me write the development report to document all the changes:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-2bf1e2e991454062ac35c693bc7a2ad6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"date +\"%Y-%m-%d\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":31878,"output":481,"cacheRead":1535,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33894,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772597888159}}
